oward the downward target without reaching full extension yet. Rear foot drives and forward foot supports; maintain connected hands and shaft. Clear intermediate extension distinct from both compression and full contact.\nNEW CELL2, final sequence frame4: immediate follow-through AFTER preserved full contact, before preserved upright recovery. Keep the original polearm aligned along the same SOUTH thrust, briefly overextend the shoulders and torso then begin drawing the shaft inward, knees counterbalance and cape settles. Distinct partial retraction, neither a fresh attack nor an upright clone.\n\nThe final animation will be: existing windup, NEW cell0 compression, NEW cell1 pre-contact, existing contact, NEW cell2 follow-through, existing recovery. Only the three NEW cells belong in this output. Newly articulate joints and equipment without rotating, translating, mirroring, recoloring or cloning an existing sprite. No sideways axe chop, spinning attack, injury/death, detached effects, aura clouds, gore, scenery, ground, labels, grids, captions or extra figures. Alpha-zero outside silhouettes. Preserve all equipment tips inside each cell. Output only the one three-pose supplemental sheet.",
